{"id":"zag","name":"ZAG","name_sl":"Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije","type":"institution","category":"zag_facility","place":"Dimičeva ulica 12, Ljubljana","municipality":"Ljubljana","latitude":46.070442,"longitude":14.513951,"position_basis":"surveyed","position_exact":true,"zag_work_from":1952,"zag_work_to":1952,"built":null,"values":15,"values_with_source":15,"has_alignment":false,"has_building_outline":true,"model":"schematic","url":"https://avtandilsvianadzeu.github.io/ZAGSloveniaTwin/twin.html?id=zag","detail":"https://avtandilsvianadzeu.github.io/ZAGSloveniaTwin/api/v1/objects/zag.json","zag_role":"Slovenian National Building and Civil Engineering Institute","zag_involvement_types":[],"description":"Founded 1994. 255 staff, six research and testing departments, a metrology department and three notified-body services under the Construction Products Regulation. Home of SiWIM bridge weigh-in-motion and of the BrAId project applying machine learning to B-WIM data quality.","history":"The institute traces its origin to 18 July 1949, when the first building and civil engineering institute in Slovenia was set up with twelve staff. It was renamed the Institute for Testing and Research in Materials and Structures, ZRMK Ljubljana, in 1952, by which time it had grown to 150 employees and had its own building on Dimičeva. After independence the government reorganised ZRMK in 1994 and 1995 and split it into two bodies. ZAG was registered on 17 March 1995 and began operating on 1 April 1995 as a governmental non profit research institute, a status that lets it act as an independent third party in testing and certification. It is organised into five departments, Materials, Building Physics, Fire Safe Sustainable Built Environment, Structures, and Geotechnics and Infrastructure, together with the Laboratory for Metrology, the Certification Service and the Service for Technical Assessment and Approvals.","facts":[["Address","Dimičeva ulica 12, 1000 Ljubljana"],["Origin","18 July 1949, twelve staff"],["Present institute","registered 17 March 1995, operating from 1 April 1995"],["Notified body","number 1404 under Regulation (EU) No 305/2011"],["Accreditation","Slovenska akreditacija LP-005, SIST EN ISO/IEC 17025, first awarded 11 November 1999"],["Certification","SIST EN ISO/IEC 17065"],["Registered researchers in SICRIS","200, in 8 research groups"],["Departments","5, plus metrology, certification and technical approvals"]],"people":[],"partners":[],"position_sources":["https://mapcarta.com/N1665982327","https://itis.siol.net/zavod-za-gradbenistvo-slovenije","https://www.zag.si/en/about-us/contacts/","https://mapcarta.com/W194663488"],"record_sources":[{"title":"The Section for Bridges and Other Civil Engineering Structures","url":"https://www.zag.si/en/organizational-units/the-department-of-structures/the-section-for-bridges-and-other-civil-engineering-structures-2/","type":"inst"},{"title":"Bridges, areas of expertise","url":"https://www.zag.si/en/areas-of-expertise/bridges/","type":"inst"},{"title":"About us","url":"https://www.zag.si/en/about-us/","type":"web"},{"title":"History","url":"https://www.zag.si/en/about-us/history/","type":"web"},{"title":"Certification Service","url":"https://www.zag.si/en/certificates-and-approvals/certification-service/","type":"web"},{"title":"Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije, accreditation LP-005","url":"https://www.slo-akreditacija.si/acreditation/zavod-za-gradbenistvo-slovenije/","type":"reg"},{"title":"Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije, organisation record 743","url":"https://cris.cobiss.net/ecris/si/sl/organization/743","type":"report"},{"title":"Contacts","url":"https://www.zag.si/en/about-us/contacts/","type":"web"},{"title":"ZAG bilten 2024","url":"https://www.zag.si/dl/ZAG-bilten-2024.pdf","type":"report"}],"specifications":[{"label":"Buildings managed by ZAG on the site (cadastre)","value":"14","unit":"","source":"https://ipi.eprostor.gov.si/wfs-si-gurs-kn/ogc/features/collections/SI.GURS.KN:DST_