office space."},{"label":"Height of hall building 962 (cadastre)","value":"14.5","unit":"m","source":"https://ipi.eprostor.gov.si/wfs-si-gurs-kn/ogc/features/collections/SI.GURS.KN:STAVBE","quote":null},{"label":"Storeys of hall building 962, below and above ground (cadastre)","value":"6","unit":"","source":"https://ipi.eprostor.gov.si/wfs-si-gurs-kn/ogc/features/collections/SI.GURS.KN:STAVBE","quote":null},{"label":"Year built, hall building 962 (cadastre)","value":"1953","unit":"","source":"https://ipi.eprostor.gov.si/wfs-si-gurs-kn/ogc/features/collections/SI.GURS.KN:STAVBE","quote":null},{"label":"Cadastre community","value":"2636 BEŽIGRAD","unit":"","source":"https://ipi.eprostor.gov.si/wfs-si-gurs-kn/ogc/features/collections/SI.GURS.KN:STAVBE","quote":null}],"source_differences":["Floors of the 1984 office building: 8 storeys below and above ground (GURS cadastre, building 892), 7 floors (dLib source, \"A seven-storey facility\"), 6 floors counted by the atlas owner on photographs. The number above ground is not confirmed by a source.","Height of the office building (cadastre building 892): the cadastre gives 23.5 m for the highest point above the terrain. Inside the same outline the laser scan surface has its middle at 21.9 m, 99 % of it stays below 26.3 m, and the highest pixel is at 27.0 m. The sources do not say what stands above 23.5 m. Laser scanning of Slovenia (GURS, CLSS, file series NDMP), read 12 November 2026.","Height of cadastre building 8300: the cadastre gives 10.0 m for the highest point above the terrain, while 99 % of the laser scan surface inside the outline stays below 13.2 m and its middle is at 9.0 m. Laser scanning of Slovenia (GURS, CLSS, file series NDMP), read 12 November 2026.","Cadastre building 1365 (13 m², recorded height 2.9 m): the laser scan surface inside the outline has its middle at 0.1 m above the ground, so the scan shows almost no raised surface there. Whether the building still stands was not checked on site. Laser scanning of Slovenia (GURS, CLSS, file series NDMP), read 12 November 2026.","Figures in the record text: 255 staff against 254 at the end of 2023 in the ZAG book of 2024, six departments in the description against five in the history text, and 1952 against 1953 for the renaming to ZRMK within the same book."],"open_question":"the number of floors above ground of the office building","reference_points":[],"model_basis":null,"rebuild_status":{"rebuildable":"partly","missing":["structural system","gross floor area","architect","floors below ground","test hall dimensions and strong floor or reaction wall data","facade"]},"cadastre_owner_and_manager":{"buildings":[{"ko":2636,"st":892,"owners":["Republika Slovenija (5854814000)"],"other":0,"managers":["Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije (5866324000)"],"parts":1},{"ko":2636,"st":962,"owners":["Republika Slovenija (5854814000)","Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije (5866324000)","KOMPAS KAPITAL, investicije in svetovanje d.o.o. (5521670000)"],"other":1,"managers":["Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije (5866324000)"],"parts":5},{"ko":2636,"st":1079,"owners":["Republika Slovenija (5854814000)","Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije (5866324000)","KOMPAS KAPITAL, investicije in svetovanje d.o.o. (5521670000)"],"other":0,"managers":["Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije (5866324000)"],"parts":2}],"parcels":[{"ko":2636,"st":"246/3","area":1941,"owners":["Republika Slovenija (5854814000) 65/100","KOMPAS KAPITAL, investicije in svetovanje d.o.o. (5521670000) 33/100","Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije (5866324000) 1/50"],"other":0,"managers":["Zavod za gradbeništvo Slovenije (5866324000)"]}]},"geometry":{"point":[14.513951,46.070442],"alignment":null,"alignment_labels":null,"building":{"height_m":23.5,"area_m2":8464,"outline":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[14.513751,46.070416],[14.513389,46.070484],[14.513339,46.070354],[14.51296,46.070424],[14.512922,46.070319],[14.513556,46.070203],[14.513531,46.070141],[14.513692,46.07011],[14.513715,46.070174],[1